        "Then come Navratri, Dussehra and the long Diwali break, followed by the cool, dry winter that suits heavy study. Exams sit over all of it: IB in May, with results in early July and November retakes; Cambridge in May-June and October-November; Edexcel in January and May-June. A student aiming at May should use November to February for the hardest teaching.",
